Exploring the KLIPY API
  URL: https://dev.to/zuplo/exploring-the-klipy-api-29po
  ### **Search Endpoint**
```
GET https://api.klipy.com/api/v1/API_KEY/gifs/search
```

### **Trending Endpoint**
```
GET
https://api.klipy.com/api/v1/API_KEY/gifs/SLUG
```

